Para Expense is a simple, efficient, beautiful and smart accounting application. Designed to improve the efficiency of accounting in your daily life and record your daily expenses and income. It’s clear at a glance how much each expense was spent, when it was spent, and where it was spent. It’s that simple! You don’t need to be an accountant. It only takes 30 seconds a day to remember good accounts. Help you manage your financial situation more easily and develop healthy spending habits.
At the same time, it also integrates the functions of multiple types of calculators to facilitate your daily use.

Simple and intuitive user interface Remember that all major operations can be completed on one interface. You even only need to enter a number to complete accounting;
Comprehensive statistics, year, relationship, account book multi-dimensional statistics, clear and clear;
You can delete and add categories, I will satisfy you as long as you want;
Detailed records of consumption income: Supports quick viewing of daily income and expenditure data at a glance, helping you quickly analyze consumption situations;
Note reminder: The powerful note function makes your accounting process easier and simpler;
Accounting pictures: Support adding bill pictures during accounting for quick accounting;
Accounting location: Supports adding location information when accounting and recording every detail;
Net Salary Calculator: Helps you calculate daily, weekly, and monthly net salary income;
Loan Calculator: A lightweight loan calculator tool that allows you to enter a fixed amount to understand your loan situation;


